Z||000000||87 Pegasus||08-11-2001||09:06 PM||||This is only an idea right now, and to see if we can get either people who would like to do this...<P>ok This is for any one in Northern Illinois and any other state or Fiero owner that would like to participate...  This would only be a one day thing, but taking a drive down old route 66...  we would start at a point were most people can find and drive to...(somewhere in the Northern Part of Illinois) we would drive to the old Dixie Truck stop just south of Normal, Illinois have lunch and chillin there or around town a little bit... But on the way we would stop and take pictures of old 66 land marks and see the Old road now some what covered by weeds....<P>If we can get enough people who would like to tour the old 66 please post...  if we can get enough people i will post a day we can do it....  I have an old and new (updated) Route 66 map so we should not get lost haha....<P>------------------<BR>Friends don't let friends drive Corvettes!!||||reg||6
