Z||000003||stimpy||08-12-2001||02:25 PM||||Hell, don't stop there! Come on down to OKC!<P>FCO recently had a leadership meeting organizing Fiero Fest X. For anyone who has made one of the shows in the past, the next show wil be a totally new animal. Instead of being hosted by the Pontiac dealership and baking our skulls in a parking lot, we are looking into securing Eldon Lyon park. This is a beautiful park with lots of trees, bathrooms and shade. And it's 3 blocks off of Route 66! Make your plans now for next May.||||reg||1
